OL,3,GNEWSANurse thought detainee was
OL,4,A'obstructive' before death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse on duty when an arrested man
OL,7,Fdied in a police station has told a
OL,8,Fcourt he thought the unconscious
OL,9,Fdetainee was simply being
OL,10,F"obstructive".
OL,12,FSean Cregg, 37, was the assigned
OL,13,Fhealthcare professional when William
OL,14,FCameron was brought into Loddon Valley
OL,15,Fpolice station in Reading, Berkshire,
OL,16,Fon the night of 7 January 2020.
OL,18,FThe jury at the Old Bailey has heard
OL,19,Fthat heard Cameron, who was 38, died of
OL,20,Fa heart attack caused by a mix of
OL,21,Falcohol, methadone and other drugs
OL,22,Fafter he was arrested.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
